================================================================================
 Container base images
================================================================================

packages/*/*/Dockerfile build FROM ubuntu:24.04 and NVIDIA CUDA / JetPack-based
runtime images (ARG BASE_IMAGE). They redistribute the Ubuntu archive, the
CUDA userspace, cuDNN and the NVIDIA driver libraries under those components'
own licenses.

