 Speech recognition — runtimes
================================================================================

- faster-whisper + CTranslate2 (wyoming-faster-whisper) ............ MIT
- parakeet.cpp — github.com/mudler/parakeet.cpp ................... MIT
- sherpa-onnx — github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx ............. Apache-2.0
- onnxruntime / onnxruntime-gpu — microsoft/onnxruntime ........... MIT
- wyoming protocol libraries — rhasspy/home-assistant ............. MIT
- Moonshine runtime (moonshine-streaming-stt) .......... see upstream repo
